Module486213Name = AuvoZugferd
Module486213Desc = Automatic Factur-X EN16931 e-invoice generation

AuvoZugferdSetup = AuvoZugferd setup
AuvoZugferdBankAccount = Bank account (IBAN/BIC)
AuvoZugferdPaymentMeans = Default payment means
AuvoZugferdPaymentMeansHint = UNTDID 4461 code. 30/58 (credit transfer) require an IBAN: without a configured bank account, the payment means block is omitted from the XML (BR-61). 59 (SEPA direct debit) publishes the creditor ICS (Dolibarr constant PRELEVEMENT_ICS), the mandate reference and the IBAN of the third party's default bank account.
PaymentMeans30 = Credit transfer
PaymentMeans58 = SEPA credit transfer
PaymentMeans59 = SEPA direct debit
PaymentMeans49 = Direct debit (national)
AuvoZugferdBrCheck = EN16931 business rules check
AuvoZugferdBrCheckHint = Checks a subset of the EN16931 Schematron rules before injection (BR-CO-10..17, BR-27, BR-61, BR-IC-11/12, VAT category consistency...). Violations block in strict mode, otherwise they are added to the warnings.
AuvoZugferdVeraPdfPath = PDF/A-3 validation with veraPDF (optional, external tool)
AuvoZugferdVeraPdfPathHint = Empty by default = disabled, and that's fine: the EN16931 XSD check and internal BR rules already run. veraPDF is NOT shipped with the module — it's a third-party tool you install yourself (https://verapdf.org), then point to here. If set, every PDF is re-validated as PDF/A-3b after injection: non blocking (a failure just adds a warning), slows generation by a few seconds.
AuvoZugferdVeraPdfPlaceholder = e.g. /usr/local/bin/verapdf — empty = disabled
AuvoZugferdInfo = Generated PDF invoices will automatically be converted to Factur-X EN16931 (PDF/A-3 with embedded CrossIndustryInvoice XML). IBAN and BIC are read from the selected bank account.
AuvoZugferdDiagTitle = Mandatory information diagnostic
AuvoZugferdDiagResults = Factur-X EN16931 + BR-FR rules check
AuvoZugferdDiagSellerName = Seller company name
AuvoZugferdDiagSellerAddress = Seller address
AuvoZugferdDiagSellerVAT = Intra-community VAT number
AuvoZugferdDiagSellerVATFranchise = not required (French VAT franchise, art. 293 B CGI) — the SIREN is published as tax identifier
AuvoZugferdDiagSellerSIRET = SIRET / SIREN
AuvoZugferdDiagSellerEmail = Seller email
AuvoZugferdDiagIBAN = Bank account IBAN
AuvoZugferdDiagBIC = Bank account BIC
AuvoZugferdDiagBankNotFound = Bank account not found
AuvoZugferdDiagBankNotSet = No bank account selected
AuvoZugferdDiagModuleBankEnabled = Bank module enabled
AuvoZugferdDiagModuleBankDisabled = Bank module disabled (required to manage the bank account)
AuvoZugferdDiagModuleInvoiceEnabled = Invoice module enabled
AuvoZugferdDiagModuleInvoiceDisabled = Invoice module disabled (required to generate invoices)
AuvoZugferdDiagForceFontOk = Embedded PDF font forced (MAIN_PDF_FORCE_FONT)
AuvoZugferdDiagForceFontMissing = MAIN_PDF_FORCE_FONT not set — without embedded fonts, the PDF is not PDF/A-3 compliant
AuvoZugferdDiagInjInProcess = In-process injection (no exec) forced — works on servers where exec() is disabled
AuvoZugferdDiagInjAuto = Automatic mode: subprocess injection (exec available) — isolated PHP process, the safest path
AuvoZugferdDiagInjAutoNoExec = Automatic mode: in-process injection (exec disabled on this server — no alternative available)
AuvoZugferdDiagInjSubprocess = Subprocess injection (exec) — legacy mode forced
AuvoZugferdDiagExecRequiredSub = "Subprocess" mode selected but exec() is disabled on this server — switch to "Automatic" or "In-process" in the configuration
AuvoZugferdDiagTcpdiConflict = In-process injection will fail: Dolibarr loads its "tcpdi" PDF engine on every generation (a TCPDF-based FPDF, incompatible with the Factur-X injection library). Two solutions: enable the exec() function on the server (the module then uses an isolated subprocess, recommended), OR set the constant MAIN_DISABLE_TCPDI = 1 (unblocks in-process, but disables Dolibarr's PDF merge features — page backgrounds, concatenation).
AuvoZugferdErrTcpdiConflict = FPDF/TCPDF conflict: Dolibarr loaded its tcpdi engine (%s), incompatible with in-process injection. Enable exec() (subprocess mode) or set the MAIN_DISABLE_TCPDI=1 constant (disables Dolibarr PDF merging).
AuvoZugferdDiagPhpCliOk = PHP CLI binary
AuvoZugferdDiagPhpCliNotFound = The configured PHP CLI binary cannot be found or is not executable: %s
AuvoZugferdDiagMulticurrencyNote = Multicurrency module enabled: invoices in a foreign currency are NOT converted to Factur-X (documented limitation, the classic PDF is kept)
AuvoZugferdDiagFixLink = Fix
AuvoZugferdDiagFixForceFont = Fix automatically (sets "pdfahelvetica")
AuvoZugferdForceFontSet = MAIN_PDF_FORCE_FONT set to "pdfahelvetica": generated PDFs now embed fonts (PDF/A-3). Global setting, applied to every PDF document in Dolibarr.
AuvoZugferdDiagAllOk = All mandatory information is filled in!
AuvoZugferdDiagNoBlocker = No blocker: Factur-X compliance is ensured. A few recommended items remain (in orange) you may address for an optimal result.

AuvoZugferdStrictMode = Error handling mode
AuvoZugferdStrictModeHint = Best-effort: if Factur-X generation fails, the classic PDF is delivered with a warning. Strict: blocks generation with a visible error if the XML is invalid or the PDF injection fails. Note: even in strict mode, the classic PDF already generated by Dolibarr remains on disk.
AuvoZugferdStrictModeBestEffort = Best-effort (default, non blocking)
AuvoZugferdStrictModeStrict = Strict (blocks if Factur-X fails)
AuvoZugferdInjectionMode = XML injection mode
AuvoZugferdInjectionModeHint = "Automatic" (recommended): subprocess if exec() is available (the safest, isolated path), and in-process only if exec() is disabled (hardened shared hosting). "In-process only" forces injection without exec() — reserve it for servers without exec(), since a PDF library conflict with another module can then prevent injection. "Subprocess" forces the legacy behaviour (requires exec()).
AuvoZugferdInjectionModeAuto = Automatic (subprocess if exec, otherwise in-process)
AuvoZugferdInjectionModeInProcess = In-process only (no exec)
AuvoZugferdInjectionModeSubprocess = Subprocess (exec, legacy)
AuvoZugferdPhpCliPath = PHP CLI binary path
AuvoZugferdPhpCliPathHint = Used only by the "subprocess" mode. Leave empty: the module auto-detects the right PHP CLI binary. Set a path only to force a specific binary (exotic setup).
AuvoZugferdLegalNotes = Mandatory French legal mentions (BR-FR-05)
AuvoZugferdNotePMD = Late payment penalties (PMD)
AuvoZugferdNotePMT = Recovery indemnity (PMT)
AuvoZugferdNoteAAB = Early payment discount (AAB)
AuvoZugferdLegalNotesForeignHint = Seller established outside France: no default mention is applied (the default texts come from the French Commercial Code). Fields left empty produce no note in the XML — enter your own mentions here if your national law requires them.

AuvoZugferdUpdateAvailable = New version available
AuvoZugferdUpdateAvailableMsg = A newer version of the module is published on GitHub (%s, current: %s).
AuvoZugferdUpdateSeeRelease = See the release and upgrade instructions

