AuvoZugferdBtnRegenerate = Regenerate Factur-X
AuvoZugferdMsgNoPdf = No PDF found for this invoice — generate the document first.
AuvoZugferdMsgNoFacturX = No Factur-X XML embedded in %s — use "Regenerate Factur-X".
AuvoZugferdMsgVerifyOk = %s: embedded Factur-X XML found, EN16931 XSD valid and business rules checked.
AuvoZugferdMsgVerifyKo = %s: embedded Factur-X XML found but not compliant:
AuvoZugferdMsgRegenerateFailed = PDF regeneration failed
AuvoZugferdMsgSuccess = Factur-X EN16931 e-invoice embedded in PDF %s.
AuvoZugferdMsgSuccessWithWarnings = Factur-X EN16931 e-invoice embedded in PDF %s. %s non blocking warning(s) to fix for full compliance:

# ODT template support (experimental, v3.8.0) — afterODTCreation hook
AuvoZugferdOdtErrNoPdfConv = ODT template without PDF conversion: Factur-X requires a PDF, but only the .odt file was produced
AuvoZugferdOdtHintEnable = set MAIN_ODT_AS_PDF = libreoffice (and install LibreOffice on the server) to convert the ODT to PDF before injection
AuvoZugferdOdtErrNoPdfa = the PDF produced from the ODT template is not PDF/A: LibreOffice then outputs a PDF >= 1.5 (compressed xref table) that the Factur-X injection library cannot read
AuvoZugferdOdtHintEnablePdfa = set MAIN_ODT_AS_PDF = libreoffice + MAIN_ODT_AS_PDFA = 1 to produce a readable, injectable PDF/A-1
AuvoZugferdOdtErrPdfMissing = expected PDF not found next to the ODT template (%s): the LibreOffice conversion probably failed (soffice binary missing or not in PATH)

AuvoZugferdErrMulticurrency = invoice in a foreign currency (%s ≠ company currency %s) — unsupported: the XML would diverge from the visible PDF (documented limitation)
AuvoZugferdErrLocalTax = invoice with local taxes (localtax1/2) — unsupported: EN16931 only represents VAT, the XML total would diverge from the visible PDF total (documented limitation)
AuvoZugferdErrNoDate = invoice has no issue date
AuvoZugferdErrNoThirdparty = buyer third party not found (fetch_thirdparty failed)
AuvoZugferdErrNoMysoc = issuing company ($mysoc) not initialised
AuvoZugferdErrInvalidXml = invalid XML
AuvoZugferdErrBrViolations = EN16931 business rules violated
AuvoZugferdErrTempDir = unable to create a temporary file in %s
AuvoZugferdErrTempWrite = unable to write the temporary XML in %s
AuvoZugferdErrNoExec = the exec() function is disabled on this server
AuvoZugferdErrPhpCliChars = AUVOZUGFERD_PHP_CLI_PATH contains forbidden characters (expected: alphanumeric path, "/ . _ - : ( ) \" and space)
AuvoZugferdErrPhpCliNotFound = the configured PHP binary cannot be found or is not executable: %s
AuvoZugferdErrInjectFailed = PDF injection failed
AuvoZugferdHintPdfKept = classic PDF kept without Factur-X
AuvoZugferdHintPdfKeptShort = classic PDF kept
AuvoZugferdHintBestEffort = best-effort mode

AuvoZugferdWarnSellerName = seller company name missing
AuvoZugferdWarnSellerAddress = seller company address missing
AuvoZugferdWarnSellerZip = seller company zip code missing
AuvoZugferdWarnSellerTown = seller company town missing
AuvoZugferdWarnSellerVAT = intra-community VAT number missing (company)
AuvoZugferdWarnSellerSIRET = SIRET/SIREN missing (company) — mandatory BR-FR-10
AuvoZugferdWarnSellerEndpoint = seller electronic address missing (no SIREN/SIRET, no email) — mandatory BR-FR-13 (BT-34)
AuvoZugferdWarnSellerSIRETLen = the seller SIRET must contain exactly 14 digits (BT-30), %s entered — a 9-digit SIREN is rejected by Chorus Pro
AuvoZugferdWarnBuyerName = buyer name missing
AuvoZugferdWarnBuyerAddress = buyer address missing
AuvoZugferdWarnBuyerZip = buyer zip code missing
AuvoZugferdWarnBuyerTown = buyer town missing
AuvoZugferdWarnBuyerEndpoint = buyer electronic address missing (no SIREN/SIRET, no email) — mandatory BR-FR-12 (BT-49)
AuvoZugferdWarnBuyerSIRENRouting = buyer SIREN/SIRET missing — required for routing on the Plateformes Agréées network (endpoint BT-49 schemeID 0225); an email alone is not routable
AuvoZugferdWarnBuyerSIRETLen = the buyer SIRET must contain exactly 14 digits (BT-47), %s entered
AuvoZugferdWarnNoBank = no bank account configured in the module
AuvoZugferdWarnNoForceFont = MAIN_PDF_FORCE_FONT not set — the generated PDF is not guaranteed PDF/A-3 (fonts not embedded); fixable in one click from the AuvoZugferd module setup (diagnostic)
AuvoZugferdWarnPaymentMeansOmitted = payment means %s (credit transfer) omitted from XML: no IBAN configured (BR-61 — configure a bank account in the module)
AuvoZugferdWarnDirectDebitNoICS = SEPA direct debit: creditor ICS missing (BT-90) — set the Dolibarr constant PRELEVEMENT_ICS
AuvoZugferdWarnDirectDebitNoRUM = SEPA direct debit: mandate reference (RUM) missing (BT-89) — fill in the third party's default bank account with its mandate reference
AuvoZugferdWarnCreditNoteNoSource = credit note without a linked source invoice: the reference to the original invoice (BG-3, mandatory French mention) cannot be emitted — create the credit note from the original invoice
AuvoZugferdWarnAllNegativeLines = fully negative invoice that is not a credit note: lines emitted as-is, the XML violates BR-27 (use a Dolibarr credit note)
AuvoZugferdWarnSituationInvoice = situation (progress billing) invoice: emitted as TypeCode 380, but the mapping of cumulative amounts/retentions is not guaranteed compliant (documented limitation)
AuvoZugferdWarnRoundingAdjusted = VAT rounding gap of %s spread on the main category to guarantee BR-CO-14 (check the totals)
AuvoZugferdWarnTaxMismatch = gap of %s between line VAT and the invoice VAT total, not attributable (no taxed category)
AuvoZugferdWarnTaxRecomputed = VAT of category %s recomputed from its basis (%s instead of %s) to satisfy BR-CO-17 — the gap with the Dolibarr total comes from per-line rounding (check the rounding mode)
AuvoZugferdWarnTotalsMismatch = XML grand total (%s) differs from the Dolibarr total (%s) — local taxes or inconsistent lines; the XML favours EN16931 internal consistency (BR-CO-15)
AuvoZugferdWarnVeraPdfNotFound = veraPDF not found or not executable: %s (AUVOZUGFERD_VERAPDF_PATH)
AuvoZugferdWarnVeraPdfFailed = veraPDF: the generated PDF is not PDF/A-3b compliant (details in syslog) — check MAIN_PDF_FORCE_FONT and the PDF template images
AuvoZugferdWarnBrPrefix = EN16931 business rule:
AuvoZugferdWarnCorrectiveNoSource = corrective invoice without a linked source invoice: the reference to the replaced invoice (BT-25, required by rule BR-FR-CO-04) cannot be emitted — create the replacement invoice from the original invoice
AuvoZugferdWarnRefTooLong = invoice reference (BT-1) too long: %s characters, maximum 35 (rule BR-FR-01)
AuvoZugferdWarnRefCharset = invoice reference (BT-1) "%s" contains characters that are not allowed — allowed: letters, digits and - + _ / , no space (rule BR-FR-02)
AuvoZugferdWarnSellerSirenSiretMismatch = seller SIREN (%s) and SIRET (%s) are inconsistent: the first 9 digits of the SIRET must match the SIREN (rule BR-FR-09) — fix the company card
AuvoZugferdWarnBuyerSirenSiretMismatch = buyer SIREN (%s) and SIRET (%s) are inconsistent: the first 9 digits of the SIRET must match the SIREN (rule BR-FR-09) — fix the third-party card
AuvoZugferdWarnVatRateNotFR = VAT rate %s %% is not in the list of allowed French rates, mainland and overseas departments (rule BR-FR-16) — check the input if this rate is not intentional
AuvoZugferdWarnEndpointSuffixCharset = the seller electronic address suffix (AUVOZUGFERD_ENDPOINT_SUFFIX_SELLER) contains characters that are not allowed — only letters, digits and - _ . are kept when emitting (rule BR-FR-23)
AuvoZugferdWarnEndpointTooLong = seller electronic address is %s characters long: maximum 125 (rule BR-FR-25) — shorten the configured suffix

