AuvoZugferdNotesInFooter = Copy the mentions into the invoice footer
AuvoZugferdNotesInFooterHint = If Yes, appends the mentions above to "Additional text on invoices" (footer of each PDF), without touching existing text. Applied on save.
AuvoZugferdPhpCliAutoPlaceholder = auto (detected)
AuvoZugferdDiagPhpCliAuto = auto-detected
AuvoZugferdSecPA = Approved Platform (PA) addressing
AuvoZugferdEndpointSuffixSeller = Seller endpoint suffix (BT-34)
AuvoZugferdEndpointSuffixSellerHint = Suffix appended to the issuer SIREN in the seller electronic address. Some Approved Platforms (e.g. Hubtimize/Esalink) require this address NOT to be the bare SIREN but a suffixed Peppol endpoint — "SIREN_Status" (lifecycle-status return address), as configured when registering the entity. Must match, byte for byte, the address registered on the PA. Empty = bare SIREN (legacy PPF directory). Does NOT affect the buyer address (BT-49), always kept as bare SIREN.
AuvoZugferdEndpointSuffixSellerPlaceholder = e.g. _Status — empty = bare SIREN
AuvoZugferdNotesOverwrite = Overwrite the existing Dolibarr mention
AuvoZugferdNotesOverwriteHint = If No, our mentions are appended after the existing "Additional text on invoices". If Yes, they replace it entirely. Either way, an empty field is filled with our mentions.
AuvoZugferdNotesAppend = append
AuvoZugferdNotesReplace = replace
AuvoZugferdChorusToNote = Copy the Chorus references to the public note
AuvoZugferdChorusToNoteHint = Adds the filled Chorus fields (framework, service code, engagement no., contract no.) to the invoice public note, which is printed on the PDF. Empty fields ignored, no duplicates.
AuvoZugferdChorusToNoteDone = %s Chorus reference(s) added to the public note
AuvoZugferdChorusToNoteAlready = The Chorus references are already in the public note
AuvoZugferdChorusToNoteEmpty = No filled Chorus field to copy
AuvoZugferdPdfFont = Generated PDF font
AuvoZugferdPdfFontHint = Font forced for all Dolibarr PDFs. For Factur-X compliance (PDF/A-3), the font must be embedded (✓). Non-compliant fonts (⚠, base-14) break PDF/A-3 validity even if the rendering looks fine. "Default font" removes the forcing.
AuvoZugferdPdfFontDefault = — Dolibarr default font (no forcing) —
AuvoZugferdPdfFontOk = ✓ Factur-X compliant (embedded)
AuvoZugferdPdfFontKo = ⚠ not PDF/A-3 compliant (not embedded)
